span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">증명서류 원본은 추천자가 삼성 면접 참석시 직접 지참하셔야 하며 면접장에서 확인 후 반납</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지도교수 추천서는 교수님과 면담 후 추천서 양식에 맞춰 작성 바람</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">-</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제출서류 미비 및 누락시 학교추천에서 제외되오니 빠짐없이 제출바람</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">-</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기회균등 특별채용 증빙서류는 제출일로부터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SI